{"ref":"BDB, אָמְנָם","hw":"אָמְנָם","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אָמְנָם</span></big>  <strong>adv. (</strong>= <span dir=\"rtl\">אֻמְנָם</span><strong>) verily, truly</strong>, in asseverations <a data-ref=\"II Kings 19:17\" href=\"/II_Kings.19.17\">2 K 19:17</a> (= <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 37:18\" href=\"/Isaiah.37.18\">Is 37:18</a>) <a data-ref=\"Job 19:4\" href=\"/Job.19.4\">Jb 19:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Job 19:5\" href=\"/Job.19.5\">5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 34:12\" href=\"/Job.34.12\">34:12</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 36:4\" href=\"/Job.36.4\">36:4</a> <a data-ref=\"Ruth 3:12\" href=\"/Ruth.3.12\">Ru 3:12</a>, also ironical <a data-ref=\"Job 9:2\" href=\"/Job.9.2\">Jb 9:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 12:2\" href=\"/Job.12.2\">12:2</a>.","next":"BDB, אֱמֶת","prev":"BDB, אֻמְנָם"}